    "summary": "The bearer may use this [Aura](vsdata:core-rule/aura-abilities) when an enemy unit 6″ or closer to them fails a test for [Battle-shock](vsdata:core-rule/battle-shock). **MONSTERS** and **VEHICLES** are excluded. Destroy a model from the tested unit, at its controller’s choice. Using the [Aura](vsdata:core-rule/aura-abilities) suppresses [mortal wounds](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds) from your [Daemonic Terror](vsdata:ability/chaos-daemons.the-shadow-of-chaos).",
